sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]

    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.SetSecurityPreferences(<br>secureConnections=enforced, mitm=enforced,<br>ioCapabilities=displayYesNo)

    Note over App: Support depends on the vendor stack.<br>Just Works (secureConnections=supported,<br>mitm=disabled, ioCapabilities=none) is always supported.<br>Certain MITM + IO capability combinations may not be<br>supported on all stacks and will assert at runtime<br>(no compile-time discoverability).
